            <div xml:id="d386">

                <pb facs="0431" n="331" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg331"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">834.156/27a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in Paraguay</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Mooney</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-03-26T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 26,
                                1919—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring to Department’s despatches February 14, 20, and March 12,<anchor n="6"
                        xml:id="d386-f1"/> regarding extension concession Construction and
                    Engineering Finance Company, you are instructed to cooperate with representative
                    of Company in Paraguay in presenting matter to Paraguayan Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
